1
00:00:00,386 --> 00:00:04,286
(Sheldon:)That would be my understanding.

2
00:00:05,357 --> 00:00:07,227
(Sheldon:)On a less painful subject,

3
00:00:07,226 --> 00:00:09,256
(Sheldon:)what size T-shirt do you take?

4
00:00:12,398 --> 00:00:15,228
(Sheldon:)Raj, you were being
a good friend,

5
00:00:15,234 --> 00:00:18,904
(Sheldon:)and my illness was no
excuse for my behavior.

6
00:00:18,904 --> 00:00:22,044
(Sheldon:)I hope that you can
accept my apology.

7
00:00:22,041 --> 00:00:23,911
(Raj:)Of course I do.

8
00:00:23,909 --> 00:00:26,909
(Sheldon:)And, Emily, I'm sorry
for saying dermatologists

9
00:00:26,912 --> 00:00:28,842
(Sheldon:)aren't real doctors.

10
00:00:28,848 --> 00:00:32,218
(Sheldon:)And I'm sure you're
tired of hearing that.

11
00:00:34,353 --> 00:00:37,323
(Emily:)Do you honestly think
I hear that a lot?

12
00:00:37,323 --> 00:00:39,753
(Sheldon:)Well, I would imagine
when your job is popping zits

13
00:00:39,758 --> 00:00:42,088
(Sheldon:)and squirting Botox
into old lady faces...

14
00:00:42,094 --> 00:00:43,394
Okay!

15
00:00:43,395 --> 00:00:46,095
(Raj:)Okay, the point is

16
00:00:46,098 --> 00:00:48,328
(Raj:)that we accept
your apology.

17
00:00:48,334 --> 00:00:49,504
(Emily:)Uh, maybe you do.

18
00:00:49,501 --> 00:00:51,301
(Emily:)He just insulted me again.

19
00:00:51,303 --> 00:00:52,973
(Raj:)Yeah, but he
doesn't mean it.

20
00:00:52,972 --> 00:00:54,642
(Emily:)Why are you defending him?

21
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:55,870
(stammers) I believe
I can answer that.

22
00:00:55,875 --> 00:00:57,045
(Sheldon:)Uh, like me,

23
00:00:57,042 --> 00:00:59,042
(Sheldon:)Raj is demonstrating empathy.

